tanding the coronary heart disease versus total cardiovascular mortality paradox</article-title><source>A method to enhance the comparability of cardiovascular death statistics in the United States. Circulation</source><fpage>2071</fpage><lpage>2081</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040327-b017"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Baiden</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Bawah</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Biai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Binka</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Boerma</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Setting international standards for verbal autopsy</article-title><source>Bull World Health Organ</source><volume>85</volume><fpage>569</fpage><lpage>648</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040327-b018"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Freeman</surname><given-names>JV</given-names></name><name><surname>Christian</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Khatry</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><name><surname>Adhikari</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>LeClerq</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Evaluation of neonatal verbal autopsy using physician review versus algorithm-based cause-of-death assignment in rural Nepal</article-title><source>Paediatr Perinat Epidemiol</source><volume>19</volume><fpage>323</fpage><lpage>331</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15958155</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040327-b019"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Quigley</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Chandramohan</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodrigues<